WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.534
The takeaway: combining spatial structure with
curiosity pays off for molecular design.

00:00:05.614 --> 00:00:09.148
By encoding 3D geometry through spatial graph attention,

00:00:09.228 --> 00:00:12.311
acting over whole fragments for synthesizability,

00:00:12.391 --> 00:00:15.860
and rewarding novelty with random network distillation,

00:00:15.940 --> 00:00:21.345
DGAPN designs tighter-binding, more synthesizable
drug candidates than prior methods,

00:00:21.425 --> 00:00:26.250
with a user-defined objective that dials between
affinity and drug-likeness.
